t up defenses, generate electricity, store resources, and support your expeditions across the planet. <br>And even the most efficient base can still look great, decorate it, and make it your own!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874540/extras/d7c9c817ca5ffc3c004993263b93ac6c.avif?t=1757349147\" width=449 height=76 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874540/extras/1cf0177cd528046a594aecda487fc863.poster.avif?t=1757349147\" width=600 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874540/extras/1cf0177cd528046a594aecda487fc863.webm?t=1757349147\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874540/extras/1cf0177cd528046a594aecda487fc863.mp4?t=1757349147\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>It turns out that the scientists were not just there to collect plant samples. Some creatures appear to have been... modified? You could utilize their modifications to your advantage as you progress. Let's defeat them all, shall we?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>","developers":["Aberratic"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874540/header.jpg?t=1757349147","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257089192,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257089192/movie480.mp4?t=1736939635","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257089192/movi